WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,300
All of you are dragons and phoenixes among men.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:07,420
It would be boring to only talk about poetry in this teacher meeting

3
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:11,770
I have something here to let you know.

4
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:16,090
Next, Chu Yue heard that the Northern Barbarian envoys came to Beijing.

5
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:19,410
And let me, the Princess of Da Chu, be removed from the shelves and pay the annual tribute

6
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:21,730
What do you think?

7
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:29,400
Peace is hard-won and should be defended

8
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,000
I think we should focus on negotiation

9
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,800
Although it can be considered

10
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:38,470
But it is absolutely impossible for the princess to be removed from the shelves

11
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:41,900
What this brother said is crude

12
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,780
Does this young man have a high sword?

13
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,300
Gao Jian is out of the question

14
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,380
Zhuo Lie knew that he had doubts.

15
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:48,660
Wish Wen Qixiang
